# ── RevenueCat notes ──
# The key above is a TEST placeholder that the app auto-detects and skips
# (no "Wrong API Key" error will appear). For real purchases replace with a
# valid RevenueCat PUBLIC SDK key:
#   • Android: starts with "goog_..."  (RevenueCat → Project settings → API keys → Google)
#   • iOS:     starts with "appl_..."  (RevenueCat → Project settings → API keys → Apple)
# The app detects the prefix — anything that doesn't start with goog_/appl_
# is treated as "no paywall" and the paywall becomes an informational page.